### 1. Check Server & LLM Health
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Discover Available Tools (Built-in + Connected MCP Servers)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/tools
Accept: application/json

### 3. Run Micro-Task Agent (Synchronous JSON Execution)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": "Inspect the project structure and summarize the core modules in internal/",
  "max_tasks": 6,
  "total_tokens": 25000
}

### 4. Run Micro-Task Agent with Code Modifications (Enable --write on server start)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": "Check internal/server/server.go and verify all endpoints handle context timeouts properly",
  "max_tasks": 4,
  "task_context_tokens": 4096
}

### 5. Run Micro-Task Agent with Real-Time SSE Streaming
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/run/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "goal": "Find all unit tests in internal/agent and verify test coverage",
  "max_tasks": 4
}
